  Id: Card_Phantom_Cell
  CardName: Phantom Cell
  Description: A tile with a neon "impassable" visual appears randomly on the 8x8
    grid. This tile is always considered "filled" for the purpose of line clear logic.
    (This means it counts towards completing a horizontal or vertical line even without
    an actual shape block on it), but it is excluded from the score calculation.
    When the row or column containing the Phantom Cell is cleared, the Phantom Cell
    vanishes and relocates to another random empty tile on the board.
